# Cart — cần JWT
@cart = {{cart}}
@token = {{token}}

### Lấy giỏ hàng
GET {{cart}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thêm variant vào giỏ (variantId=115 — product 1)
POST {{cart}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variantId": 115,
  "quantity": 1
}
